clared a National Cultural Heritage by Resolución Directoral Nacional No. 040/INC on January 29, 2002 [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96478", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_name ''1000 - 1500 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96479", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: period_start ''1200'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:96480", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s005: site_type ''City/town/settlement'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:146364", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-007: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cf/Tarmatambo.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/33e2399e/hero.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:236567", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-02b_fields-wd3-s003: site_type None -> ''Archaeological site''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302112", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''1000 - 1500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302113", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''1438''"}]'::jsonb),
