 parts: the city of Las Quintanas, the necropolis of Las Ruedas, and the potter''s district of Carralaceña [1].\""}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104232", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:104233", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s014: period_start ''-500'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:156125", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-020: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/Necr%C3%B3polis_de_Las_Ruedas.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/96395824/Pintia.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302165", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''1500 - 500 BC''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302166", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''-600''"}]'::jsonb),
