 situ in 1878 [1]. The first publication was made by Theodor Nöldeke on July 10, 1884, with information provided by Julius Euting [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124316", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: lat ''48.861301646608645'' -> ''27.62972''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124317", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: lon ''2.335844025900915'' -> ''38.54389''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124318", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_name ''1500 - 500 BC'' -> ''500 BC - 1 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124319", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: period_start ''-1500'' -> ''-500''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:124320", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26b_fields-wd1-s009: site_type ''Rock relief/carving'' -> ''Inscription''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:162872", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-029: thumbnail_url ''https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/Teima_stone_Louvre_AO1505.jpg'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/ce733a7d/Tayma stones (173).webp''"}]'::jsonb),
