 belonged to people of different economic status [1]. There are also, basilicas, a tetrapylon, cisterns and a partially unearthed Roman road [1].''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111515", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_name ''500 BC - 1 AD'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:111516", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-09-26d_fields-wd1-s022: period_start ''-300'' -> None"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:165974", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "served-image-2026-09-30-033: thumbnail_url ''/data/images/wiki/f294fd21/hero.webp'' -> ''/data/images/wiki/f294fd21/Karakabaklı7.webp''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302210", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_name None -> ''1 - 500 AD''"}, {"source": "remediation_change_log:302211", "url": "remediation_change_log", "quote": "2026-10-04a_fields-wd4-s001: period_start None -> ''330''"}]'::jsonb),
